(7310372, 1140511, 136989, '<td valign="top">Thank you for visually capturing how my brain feels after 3 days of straight homework.  :)  I love the balance of warm and cool colors as well as the details in the "dots".  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thank you for visually capturing how my brain feels after 3 days of straight homework.  :)  I love the balance of warm and cool colors as well as the details in the "dots".  My favorite in this challenge.', '2015-02-03 23:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
