(7310387, 1140370, 61552, '<td valign="top">OK, you''re right, it''s not really oil.  But get some on your hands!  That''ll change your mind.  The photo doesn''t really do justice to the sparkle from the sap when the sun hits it just right.  Thank you!  Did better than I thought. :)</td>', 'OK, you''re right, it''s not really oil.  But get some on your hands!  That''ll change your mind.  The photo doesn''t really do justice to the sparkle from the sap when the sun hits it just right.  Thank you!  Did better than I thought. :)', '2015-02-04 00:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
