(7310409, 1140230, 68504, '<td valign="top">tragic. reminds me of our first long trip in our new mini with a teething infant. leak in the oil line inside the car dripping onto the floor. camping gear on the roof rack, not skis. tragic and sweet.</td>', 'tragic. reminds me of our first long trip in our new mini with a teething infant. leak in the oil line inside the car dripping onto the floor. camping gear on the roof rack, not skis. tragic and sweet.', '2015-02-04 01:24:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7310423, 1140497, 37858, '<td valign="top">I want to thank those who commented on this image.  I am just now learning about flash and using it for the first time or two.  I totally agree with those who mentioned the lack of definition in the bottles due to the dark black background.  I also concur with the observation that the light was too harsh. I will continue to experiment to improve my use of flash and other artificial light sources and to learn about rendering a more subtle light.  Thanks for commenting.  It is helpful and appreciated.</td>', 'I want to thank those who commented on this image.  I am just now learning about flash and using it for the first time or two.  I totally agree with those who mentioned the lack of definition in the bottles due to the dark black background.  I also concur with the observation that the light was too harsh. I will continue to experiment to improve my use of flash and other artificial light sources and to learn about rendering a more subtle light.  Thanks for commenting.  It is helpful and appreciated.', '2015-02-04 02:16:42.000000', NULL, 0),
