(7310651, 1140511, 144271, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the nice comments and votes.  I had no idea this would do so well.  I got the idea from this website and I was amazed at how beautiful they were.  <a href="//www.thisiscolossal.com/2013/09/high-speed-photographs-of-ink-mixing-with-oil-by-alberto-seveso/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.thisiscolossal.com/2013/09/high-speed-photographs-of-ink-mixing-with-oil-by-alberto-seveso/</a>  Unfortunately my attempts did not measure up to this.  I was unable to get that clarity but I did notice that when the drops of ink were near the bottom that they were still round so I stirred them up and got this.  The ribbon was well worth the ink that was spilled on my rug during this whole photo shoot.  Thanks again</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the nice comments and votes.  I had no idea this would do so well.  I got the idea from this website and I was amazed at how beautiful they were.  //www.thisiscolossal.com/2013/09/high-speed-photographs-of-ink-mixing-with-oil-by-alberto-seveso/  Unfortunately my attempts did not measure up to this.  I was unable to get that clarity but I did notice that when the drops of ink were near the bottom that they were still round so I stirred them up and got this.  The ribbon was well worth the ink that was spilled on my rug during this whole photo shoot.  Thanks again', '2015-02-04 10:26:37.000000', NULL, 0),
